<title>GERMANY: SNI, EMC Corp in marketing deal.</title>
<headline>SNI, EMC Corp in marketing deal.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German computer maker Siemens Nixdorf Informationssysteme AG said on Tuesday it would market server and memory subsystems worldwide for U.S. technology group EMC Corp.</p>
<p>The company gave no financial details about the agreement.</p>
<p>Siemens would offer EMC memory subsystems for servers as part of its line of server products.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097 150</p>
